---
import FullNavigationLayout from "../../astro/layouts/FullNavigationLayout.astro";
---

<FullNavigationLayout>
  <main class="mr-container mr-shell__main">
    <h1>Group is deprecated</h1>
    <p>
      <code>.group</code> is a historical layout helper and is deprecated. It is no
      longer a component and is not shipped by the stable CSS bundle.
    </p>
    <p>
      Use <a href="../../usage/layout/"><code>.mr-cluster</code> and the layout primitives</a>
      for new code.
    </p>

    <h2>Migration</h2>
    <pre data-mr-copyable><code>{`<!-- Deprecated -->
<div class="group group-spaced-between">...</div>

<!-- Stable API -->
<div class="mr-cluster mr-cluster--between">...</div>`}</code></pre>

    <p>
      The old Group layout responsibility is covered by <code>.mr-cluster</code>.
      Historical button-specific presentation that happened to live inside Group is
      not part of the layout primitive; buttons use normal Markup Refine button styling.
    </p>
  </main>
</FullNavigationLayout>
